    "updated_at": "2022-01-25T22:03:12Z",
    "body": "I made a [test case](https://purring-various-felidae.glitch.me/delayed-import-media-mismatch.html).\r\n\r\nChrome and Safari treat it as script-blocking. Firefox doesn't.",
