    "created_at": "2022-01-25T22:39:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-25T22:39:47Z",
    "body": "Hmm OK. I wonder if there's some common trick that made browsers go this route, e.g. something where the developers switches the `media=\"\"` attribute to something matching later and expects the styles to be applied instantly.\r\n\r\nAnyway, given the lack of interop here we can definitely revisit the desired behavior, and consider changing it in the spec if we want...",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
